eight":40},{"text":"전화를","x":817,"y":1543,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"거는","x":934,"y":1542,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"날이","x":1016,"y":1542,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"올","x":1097,"y":1543,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1146,"y":1542,"width":108,"height":40}]},{"text":"내장형 시스템은 거의 언제나 실시간 운영체제를 수행한다. 실시간 시스템은 처리기","words":[{"text":"내장형","x":401,"y":1608,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":517,"y":1608,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"거의","x":671,"y":1609,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"언제나","x":755,"y":1609,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":871,"y":1608,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"운영체제를","x":988,"y":1608,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"수행한다.","x":1174,"y":1608,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"실시간","x":1334,"y":1609,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"시스템은","x":1450,"y":1609,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"처리기","x":1601,"y":1611,"width":98,"height":40}]},{"text":"의 작동이나 데이터의 흐름에 엄격한 시간 제약이 있을 때 人용된다. 따라서 실시간 시","words":[{"text":"의","x":337,"y":1673,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"작동이나","x":385,"y":1672,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"데이터의","x":539,"y":1674,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"흐름에","x":693,"y":1674,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"엄격한","x":816,"y":1674,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":935,"y":1673,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"제약이","x":1020,"y":1674,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"있을","x":1141,"y":1674,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1223,"y":1675,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"人용된다.","x":1270,"y":1674,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"따라서","x":1432,"y":1676,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":1550,"y":1677,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"시","x":1669,"y":1678,"width":30,"height":39}]},{"text":"스템은 종종 전용 응용에서 제어 장치로 八卜우된다. 감지기가 데이터를 컴퓨터로 가져온","words":[{"text":"스템은","x":336,"y":1738,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"종종","x":453,"y":1739,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"전용","x":539,"y":1738,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"응용에서","x":620,"y":1739,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"제어","x":776,"y":1738,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"장치로","x":859,"y":1738,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"八卜우된다.","x":980,"y":1739,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"감지기가","x":1144,"y":1740,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"데이터를","x":1296,"y":1741,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"컴퓨터로","x":1449,"y":1742,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"가져온","x":1601,"y":1743,"width":103,"height":39}]},{"text":"다. 컴퓨터는 반드시 데이터를 분석하고, 아마도 감지기의 입력을 변경할 수 있도록 제","words":[{"text":"다.","x":338,"y":1802,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":398,"y":1802,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"반드시","x":550,"y":1803,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":670,"y":1803,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"분석하고,","x":823,"y":1803,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"아마도","x":991,"y":1803,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"감지기의","x":1110,"y":1805,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"입력을","x":1266,"y":1806,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"변경할","x":1384,"y":1807,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1500,"y":1808,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"있도록","x":1554,"y":1809,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"제","x":1671,"y":1809,"width":31,"height":39}]},{"text":"어를 조정할 것이다. 과학 실험을 제어하는 시스템, 의학 영상 시스템, 산업 제어 시스템,","words":[{"text":"어를","x":339,"y":1867,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"조정할","x":418,"y":1866,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":536,"y":1867,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"과학","x":659,"y":1868,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"실험을","x":744,"y":1868,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"제어하는","x":861,"y":1869,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"시스템,","x":1013,"y":1869,"width":112,"height":41},{"text":"의학","x":1141,"y":1871,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"영상","x":1224,"y":1871,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"시스템,","x":1304,"y":1872,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"산업","x":1428,"y":1872,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"제어","x":1512,"y":1873,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"시스템,","x":1594,"y":1873,"width":112,"height":40}]},{"text":"그리고 몇몇 디스플레이 시스템 등이 실시간 시스템이다. 또한, 일부 자동차 엔진 연료","words":[{"text":"그리고","x":337,"y":1931,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"몇몇","x":458,"y":1931,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"디스플레이","x":541,"y":1931,"width":167,"height":40},{"text":"시스템","x":729,"y":1932,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"등이","x":847,"y":1934,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":935,"y":1934,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"시스템이다.","x":1056,"y":1935,"width":179,"height":40},{"text":"또한,","x":1253,"y":1936,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"일부","x":1350,"y":1937,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"자동차","x":1432,"y":1937,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"엔진","x":1554,"y":1938,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"연료","x":1640,"y":1938,"width":66,"height":37}]},{"text":"분사 시스템, 가전 기기 컨트롤러, 그리고 무기 시스템들도 실시간 시스템에 포함된다","words":[{"text":"분사","x":338,"y":1996,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"시스템,","x":420,"y":1995,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"가전","x":545,"y":1996,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"기기","x":626,"y":1997,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"컨트롤러,","x":708,"y":1997,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":867,"y":1999,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"무기","x":985,"y":2000,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"시스템들도","x":1067,"y":2001,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"실시간","x":1253,"y":2001,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"시스템에","x":1369,"y":2002,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"포함된다","x":1520,"y":2003,"width":146,"height":39}]},{"text":"실시간 시스템은 잘 정의된, 고정된 시간 제약을 가진다. 정의된 제한 시간 내에 처","words":[{"text":"실시간","x":404,"y":2061,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":521,"y":2061,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"잘","x":672,"y":2062,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"정의된,","x":723,"y":2062,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"고정된","x":849,"y":2064,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":971,"y":2064,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"제약을","x":1054,"y":2065,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"가진다.","x":1173,"y":2066,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"정의된","x":1301,"y":2067,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"제한","x":1420,"y":2068,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1504,"y":2068,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"내에","x":1589,"y":2067,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"처","x":1673,"y":2069,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"리가 반드시 이루어져야 하며, 그렇지 않으면 시스템은 실패하게 된다. 예를 든다면, 로","words":[{"text":"리가","x":342,"y":2126,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"반드시","x":425,"y":2126,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"이루어져야","x":542,"y":2126,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"하며,","x":726,"y":2127,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"그렇지","x":819,"y":2129,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"않으면","x":940,"y":2129,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"시스템은","x":1057,"y":2129,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"실패하게","x":1211,"y":2131,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1363,"y":2132,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1459,"y":2133,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"든다면,","x":1541,"y":2133,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"로","x":1671,"y":2136,"width":36,"height":29}]},{"text":"봇 팔이 제작 중인 자동차를 파괴하고 난 후에 중지하라는 명령을 내린다면 아무 소용이","words":[{"text":"봇","x":339,"y":2191,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"팔이","x":388,"y":2191,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"제작","x":469,"y":2191,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"중인","x":549,"y":2191,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"자동차를","x":632,"y":2191,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"파괴하고","x":781,"y":2192,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"난","x":933,"y":2194,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"후에","x":979,"y":2194,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"중지하라는","x":1062,"y":2194,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"명령을","x":1250,"y":2195,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"내린다면","x":1366,"y":2197,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"아무","x":1518,"y":2198,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"소용이","x":1600,"y":2197,"width":103,"height":38}]},{"text":"없을 것이다. 실시간 시스템은 정해진 시간 제약 내에 올바른 결괴를 돌려줄 수 있을 때","words":[{"text":"없을","x":343,"y":2256,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":424,"y":2256,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"실시간","x":549,"y":2256,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":666,"y":2256,"width":138,"height":38},{"text